            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">They have been swapped to stderr for json mode, but I think they should always be on stderr. I think an open question would be if they should be called with <code class=\"notranslate\">output.error</code> or as an actual log (maybe with a custom <code class=\"notranslate\">META</code> prefix)? <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"910070198\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/3354\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/cli/issues/3354/hovercard?comment_id=2108901091&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/3354#issuecomment-2108901091\">npm/cli#3354 (comment)</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1072",
            "title": "make `run-script` banners a log event",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-14T20:33:14.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-24T21:05:26.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
                "url": "https://github.com/wraithgar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Our help pages will still be in man format, and displayed via man, but we do not need to support <code class=\"notranslate\">man install</code> opening npm cli docs.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1071",
            "title": "stop installing actual man pages",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-26T18:48:07.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-24T21:01:32.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
                "url": "https://github.com/wraithgar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Whatever systems are in place when npm is spawned that determine which node bin to use should not be altered when npm itself spawns node.  This potentially leads to differing node runtimes being ran for the same npm operation.</p>",
